Package: Compositionalscsmr
Type: Package
Title: Simplically Constrained Spatial Median Regression for Compositional Data Regression
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-08-13
Authors@R: person("Michail", "Tsagris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtsagris@uoc.gr")
Author: Michail Tsagris [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Michail Tsagris <mtsagris@uoc.gr>
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: Compositional, MASS, Matrix, quadprog, rangen, Rfast
Suggests: Rfast2
Description: Simplicial-simplicial regression is performed via the simplicially constrained spatial median regression model. The regression coefficients are constrained to be non-negative and sum to 1. For the spatial median regression the iteratively reweighted least squares algorithm is adopted, where quadratic programming is ued to impose the constraints.
